---
import SiteLayout from "../../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import TopicNav from "../../../../components/TopicNav.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../../../lib/routes";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL ?? "/";
const rankings = [
  { label: "PB only", labelZh: "仅用 PB 排序", annual: 12.05, excess: 7.25, drawdown: 46.74, ratio: 0.66 },
  { label: "PB + static ROE", labelZh: "PB + 静态 ROE", annual: 9.06, excess: 4.27, drawdown: 45.40, ratio: 0.42 },
  { label: "PB + ROE change", labelZh: "PB + ROE 变化", annual: 11.59, excess: 6.80, drawdown: 46.98, ratio: 0.65 },
  { label: "Quality-adjusted PB residual", labelZh: "质量调整 PB 残差", annual: 12.01, excess: 7.21, drawdown: 47.26, ratio: 0.67 },
  { label: "PB residual + ROE change", labelZh: "PB 残差 + ROE 变化", annual: 11.66, excess: 6.87, drawdown: 47.02, ratio: 0.65 },
];
const quality = [
  { label: "Three quality conditions off", labelZh: "三项条件关闭", annual: 7.56, excess: 2.69, drawdown: 44.60, ratio: 0.19 },
  { label: "Three quality conditions on", labelZh: "三项条件开启", annual: 12.40, excess: 7.53, drawdown: 48.26, ratio: 0.69 },
];
---
<SiteLayout title="PB 与 ROE 历史对照" titleEn="PB and ROE historical comparison" description="PB 与 ROE 的历史配对结果、候选池审计和证据边界。" section="research">
  <TopicNav sections={[{ id: "topic-content", label: "主要发现", labelEn: "Key findings", available: true }, { id: "ranking-evidence", label: "同池排序", labelEn: "Within-pool ranking", available: true }, { id: "quality-evidence", label: "候选池审计", labelEn: "Candidate-pool audit", available: true }, { id: "research-method", label: "数据与限制", labelEn: "Data and limits", available: true }]} />
  <article id="topic-content" class="research-report pbroe-report">
    <header class="theme-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Factors and style · historical experiment" data-zh="因子与风格 · 历史实验">Factors and style · historical experiment</span><h1 data-locale-text data-en="PB and ROE: historical comparison and evidence boundary" data-zh="PB 与 ROE：历史对照与证据边界">PB and ROE: historical comparison and evidence boundary</h1><p data-locale-text data-en="Read valuation ranking, profitability conditions, and candidate-pool changes separately. This is a reviewed public summary through 2026-08-31." data-zh="把估值排序、盈利能力条件与候选池变化分开阅读。以下是已核对源结果的公开汇总，数据截至 2026-08-31。">Read valuation ranking, profitability conditions, and candidate-pool changes separately. This is a reviewed public summary through 2026-08-31.</p></div><span class="evidence-status exploratory" data-locale-text data-en="Evidence status · exploratory" data-zh="证据状态 · 探索性">Evidence status · exploratory</span></header>
    <p><span data-locale-text data-en="The consolidated factor-research entry point is the PB/ROE study in the " data-zh="因子研究的统一入口现位于 ">The consolidated factor-research entry point is the </span><a href="https://runchengxie.github.io/quant-factor-observatory/studies/pb-roe" data-locale-text data-en="Quant Factor Observatory ↗" data-zh="Quant Factor Observatory 的 PB/ROE 专题 ↗">Quant Factor Observatory ↗</a><span data-locale-text data-en=". This page preserves the original public review and market-research context." data-zh="。本页保留原始公开核对和市场研究上下文。">. This page preserves the original public review and market-research context.</span></p>
    <section class="report-section report-conclusion"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Key finding" data-zh="先看发现">Key finding</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Adding static ROE did not improve this historical ranking within the same candidate universe." data-zh="在同一候选池内，加入静态 ROE 没有改善这组历史排序。">Adding static ROE did not improve this historical ranking within the same candidate universe.</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="In the month-end panel from 2010-01-29 through 2026-08-31, the 50-stock PB ranking returned 12.05% annualized, versus 9.06% for PB plus static ROE; their information ratios were 0.66 and 0.42. ROE changes and the PB residual adjusted for quality variables also showed no clear incremental gain. This is an observation under specific definitions and a specific sample, not evidence that ROE is generally ineffective." data-zh="2010-01-29 至 2026-08-31 的月末面板上，50 只股票组合的 PB 排序年化收益为 12.05%，PB 加静态 ROE 为 9.06%；对应信息比率分别为 0.66 和 0.42。ROE 变化与质量变量调整后的 PB 残差也未显示明确增量。这是特定定义与样本下的观察，不能推断 ROE 普遍无效。">In the month-end panel from 2010-01-29 through 2026-08-31, the 50-stock PB ranking returned 12.05% annualized, versus 9.06% for PB plus static ROE; their information ratios were 0.66 and 0.42. ROE changes and the PB residual adjusted for quality variables also showed no clear incremental gain. This is an observation under specific definitions and a specific sample, not evidence that ROE is generally ineffective.</p></section>
    <section class="stat-grid report-stats"><article class="stat accent"><span data-locale-text data-en="PB ranking" data-zh="PB 排序">PB ranking</span><strong>12.05%</strong><small data-locale-text data-en="Annualized return in the shared universe" data-zh="同池历史年化收益">Annualized return in the shared universe</small></article><article class="stat"><span>PB + static ROE</span><strong>9.06%</strong><small data-locale-text data-en="Annualized return in the shared universe" data-zh="同池历史年化收益">Annualized return in the shared universe</small></article><article class="stat"><span data-locale-text data-en="Quality-condition audit" data-zh="质量条件审计">Quality-condition audit</span><strong>+46,803</strong><small data-locale-text data-en="Additional stock-month records without the non-null ROE requirement" data-zh="去掉 ROE 非空要求后新增股票月记录">Additional stock-month records without the non-null ROE requirement</small></article></section>

    <section id="ranking-evidence" class="report-section"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Rankings within one universe" data-zh="同池排序对照">Rankings within one universe</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Five rankings, four metrics" data-zh="五种排序，四项指标一起看">Five rankings, four metrics</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="The chart compares five rankings on the same candidate universe of 50 stocks, using the same fees and daily execution approximation. Bar length represents annualized portfolio return; annualized excess return is relative to the CSI All Share Total Return Index, and drawdown is the historical maximum drawdown of portfolio NAV. Values are labeled directly; bar length is not a forecast interval." data-zh="下图只比较同一候选池、50 只股票、相同费用和日频近似执行规则下的五种排序。柱长代表组合年化收益；年化超额相对于中证全指全收益，回撤为组合净值的历史最大回撤。每行的数值都直接标出，柱长不表示预测区间。">The chart compares five rankings on the same candidate universe of 50 stocks, using the same fees and daily execution approximation. Bar length represents annualized portfolio return; annualized excess return is relative to the CSI All Share Total Return Index, and drawdown is the historical maximum drawdown of portfolio NAV. Values are labeled directly; bar length is not a forecast interval.</p>
      <figure class="evidence-figure" aria-labelledby="ranking-chart-title"><figcaption id="ranking-chart-title" data-locale-text data-en="Historical annualized return and risk · 2010-01-29 to 2026-08-31" data-zh="五种排序的历史年化收益与风险 · 2010-01-29 至 2026-08-31">Historical annualized return and risk · 2010-01-29 to 2026-08-31</figcaption><div class="evidence-chart-head"><span data-locale-text data-en="Ranking method" data-zh="排序方式">Ranking method</span><span data-locale-text data-en="Annualized return · 0–14%" data-zh="组合年化收益 · 0–14%">Annualized return · 0–14%</span><span data-locale-text data-en="Excess / information ratio / max drawdown" data-zh="年化超额 / 信息比率 / 最大回撤">Excess / information ratio / max drawdown</span></div><div class="evidence-chart-rows">{rankings.map((row, index) => <div class="evidence-chart-row"><span class="evidence-chart-label" data-locale-text data-en={row.label} data-zh={row.labelZh}>{row.label}</span><div class="evidence-chart-measure"><div class="evidence-bar-track"><span class:list={["evidence-bar-fill", { muted: index !== 0 }]} style={`width: ${row.annual / 14 * 100}%`}></span></div><strong>{row.annual.toFixed(2)}%</strong></div><small><span data-locale-text data-en="Excess" data-zh="超额">Excess</span> {row.excess.toFixed(2)}% <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> IR {row.ratio.toFixed(2)} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span data-locale-text data-en="Drawdown" data-zh="回撤">Drawdown</span> {row.drawdown.toFixed(2)}%</small></div>)}</div><p class="evidence-figure-note" data-locale-text data-en="“PB only” refers only to the ranking signal. Eligibility still requires computable ROE, so this is not a strict pure-PB portfolio." data-zh="“仅用 PB 排序”仅指排序信号；基础资格仍要求 ROE 可计算，不能当作严格纯 PB 组合。">“PB only” refers only to the ranking signal. Eligibility still requires computable ROE, so this is not a strict pure-PB portfolio.</p></figure>
    </section>

    <section id="quality-evidence" class="report-section"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Candidate-universe audit" data-zh="不同候选池的审计">Candidate-universe audit</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Missing ROE and quality conditions change the sample" data-zh="ROE 缺失与质量条件会改变样本">Missing ROE and quality conditions change the sample</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="Removing the non-null ROE eligibility rule increases eligible stock-month records from 611,508 to 658,311: 46,803 additional records, or 7.11% of the expanded sample. Stock-month records are not counts of unique securities or portfolio holdings." data-zh="取消 ROE 非空资格后，合格股票月记录由 611,508 增至 658,311，新增 46,803 条，占扩大后样本的 7.11%。这里的股票月记录数不等于独立股票数量，也不等于组合持仓数量。">Removing the non-null ROE eligibility rule increases eligible stock-month records from 611,508 to 658,311: 46,803 additional records, or 7.11% of the expanded sample. Stock-month records are not counts of unique securities or portfolio holdings.</p>
      <figure class="evidence-figure" aria-labelledby="universe-chart-title"><figcaption id="universe-chart-title" data-locale-text data-en="Effect of ROE availability on eligible stock-month records" data-zh="ROE 可用性对候选股票月记录数的影响">Effect of ROE availability on eligible stock-month records</figcaption><div class="evidence-chart-rows"><div class="evidence-chart-row"><span class="evidence-chart-label" data-locale-text data-en="ROE required" data-zh="要求 ROE 非空">ROE required</span><div class="evidence-chart-measure"><div class="evidence-bar-track"><span class="evidence-bar-fill muted" style="width: 92.89%"></span></div><strong>611,508</strong></div><small data-locale-text data-en="Original eligibility rule" data-zh="原基础资格">Original eligibility rule</small></div><div class="evidence-chart-row"><span class="evidence-chart-label" data-locale-text data-en="Missing ROE allowed" data-zh="允许 ROE 缺失">Missing ROE allowed</span><div class="evidence-chart-measure"><div class="evidence-bar-track"><span class="evidence-bar-fill" style="width: 100%"></span></div><strong>658,311</strong></div><small data-locale-text data-en="Expanded universe · +7.11%" data-zh="扩大后候选池 · +7.11%">Expanded universe · +7.11%</small></div></div></figure>
      <p data-locale-text data-en="A separate experiment in the expanded universe jointly toggles three quality conditions: goodwill, leverage, and revenue. Its returns and drawdowns cannot be directly differenced against the five within-universe rankings above or attributed to any one condition." data-zh="在扩大后的候选范围内，另一项实验同时开关商誉、杠杆和营收三项质量条件。下图中的收益与回撤属于该实验，不能和上面的五种同池排序直接相减或解释为单项条件的贡献。">A separate experiment in the expanded universe jointly toggles three quality conditions: goodwill, leverage, and revenue. Its returns and drawdowns cannot be directly differenced against the five within-universe rankings above or attributed to any one condition.</p>
      <figure class="evidence-figure" aria-labelledby="quality-chart-title"><figcaption id="quality-chart-title" data-locale-text data-en="Historical results with all three quality conditions toggled together" data-zh="三项质量条件同时开关的历史结果">Historical results with all three quality conditions toggled together</figcaption><div class="evidence-chart-head"><span data-locale-text data-en="Quality conditions" data-zh="质量条件">Quality conditions</span><span data-locale-text data-en="Annualized return · 0–14%" data-zh="组合年化收益 · 0–14%">Annualized return · 0–14%</span><span data-locale-text data-en="Excess / information ratio / max drawdown" data-zh="年化超额 / 信息比率 / 最大回撤">Excess / information ratio / max drawdown</span></div><div class="evidence-chart-rows">{quality.map((row, index) => <div class="evidence-chart-row"><span class="evidence-chart-label" data-locale-text data-en={row.label} data-zh={row.labelZh}>{row.label}</span><div class="evidence-chart-measure"><div class="evidence-bar-track"><span class:list={["evidence-bar-fill", { muted: index === 0 }]} style={`width: ${row.annual / 14 * 100}%`}></span></div><strong>{row.annual.toFixed(2)}%</strong></div><small><span data-locale-text data-en="Excess" data-zh="超额">Excess</span> {row.excess.toFixed(2)}% <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> IR {row.ratio.toFixed(2)} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span data-locale-text data-en="Drawdown" data-zh="回撤">Drawdown</span> {row.drawdown.toFixed(2)}%</small></div>)}</div><p class="evidence-figure-note" data-locale-text data-en="With the conditions enabled, return is higher but maximum drawdown deepens from 44.60% to 48.26%. All three conditions change together, so this is not a single-variable causal estimate." data-zh="条件开启时收益更高，最大回撤也从 44.60% 加深至 48.26%；三项条件同时变化，不能作单变量因果解释。">With the conditions enabled, return is higher but maximum drawdown deepens from 44.60% to 48.26%. All three conditions change together, so this is not a single-variable causal estimate.</p></figure>
    </section>

    <section id="research-method" class="report-section report-next"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Data and limitations" data-zh="数据与限制">Data and limitations</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Results have been reviewed; the full experiment still needs independent replication" data-zh="结果已经核对，完整实验仍需独立复现">Results have been reviewed; the full experiment still needs independent replication</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="Data run through 2026-08-31. The public summary was checked against result CSVs, run manifests, and audit records in a private source project. Source code, raw data, and complete artifacts are not public, and this site has not independently rerun the full history. Financial-report availability dates have not been independently checked filing by filing. The historical period informed the research and is not a strict out-of-sample test. Close-price execution approximations do not include full market impact or replay of actual fills." data-zh="数据截至 2026-08-31；公开汇总已对照私有源项目的结果 CSV、运行清单及审计记录。源代码、原始数据和完整产物未公开，本站没有独立重跑完整历史。财报公告可见时间尚未逐份独立核查；历史区间已参与研究探索，不能视作严格样本外。收盘价近似执行尚未覆盖完整冲击成本与真实成交回放。">Data run through 2026-08-31. The public summary was checked against result CSVs, run manifests, and audit records in a private source project. Source code, raw data, and complete artifacts are not public, and this site has not independently rerun the full history. Financial-report availability dates have not been independently checked filing by filing. The historical period informed the research and is not a strict out-of-sample test. Close-price execution approximations do not include full market impact or replay of actual fills.</p><p data-locale-text data-en="These results describe historical research only. They do not support replacing a production strategy or trading on the results." data-zh="这些结果只用于描述历史研究，不支持直接替换生产策略或据此交易。">These results describe historical research only. They do not support replacing a production strategy or trading on the results.</p></section>
    <nav class="report-links" aria-label="PB and ROE research links"><a class="button-link" data-locale-text data-en="Read the full data and methodology ↗" data-zh="阅读完整数据与方法 ↗" href={withBase("/docs/research/factors/pb-roe/", base)}>Read the full data and methodology ↗</a><a class="button-link secondary" data-locale-text data-en="View style-factor research ↗" data-zh="查看风格因子研究 ↗" href={withBase("/research/style-factors-18y/", base)}>View style-factor research ↗</a></nav>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
